<title>USA: Worthington sees expansion on line in September.</title>
<headline>Worthington sees expansion on line in September.</headline>
<dateline>WORTHINGTON, Ohio 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Worthington Foods Inc said it expects its Zanesville line expansion to be operational by the end of September.</p>
<p>The company said the project is running on budget. It said it expects the project will provide an additional $30 million manufacturing capacity for Morningstar Farms products.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
